  "description": "COWVAO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C176 H168 Gd4 N12 O16,8(C2 H3 N1),2(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.584-3.951 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.68-111.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C194H196Cl4Gd4N20O16.",
